  "title": "Dinah's Stuffed Mushrooms",
  "description": "Delicious mushroom caps filled with a clam stuffing! Very easy, and even better than the stuffed mushrooms from that famous Italian restaurant chain.... Garnish with lemon wedges when serving.",
  "authors": [
    "Dinah"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-03-21T12:18:15-04:00",
